Step 3 – Create Login Lambda
3.1 What will this Lambda do?
When the student clicks Login:
1. Receive username and password from API Gateway.
2. Retrieve the username record from DynamoDB.
3. Check whether the account status is ACTIVE.
4. Extract the stored salt and password hash.
5. Generate a new PBKDF2 hash using the supplied password.
6. Compare the hashes.
7. Return authentication success or failure.

